OL,3,W"###"###"###T//////,,.-.-.,,-,.,.//////
OL,4,CTorrent of flood water from old mine   
OL,5,Cruined our homes - we fear it will     
OL,6,Chappen again                           
OL,7,GFamilies whose homes were submerged by 
OL,8,Ga torrent of mine water after a quarry 
OL,9,Gblast fear their children could be     
OL,10,Gcaught in another flood as experts     
OL,11,Gwarn other UK communities may be at    
OL,12,Grisk.                                  
OL,14,FFifteen homes in the of village of     
OL,15,FGwaelod-y-Garth, north of Cardiff were 
OL,16,Faffected - and 13 evacuated - when a   
OL,17,F"tsunami river" from old iron mine     
OL,18,Fworkings hit after a planned quarry    
OL,19,Fexplosion in south Wales.              
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
