OL,4,CPolice chief says racists and          
OL,5,Cmisogynists working inside force       
OL,6,GThe chief of Wales' largest police     
OL,7,Gforce says he is working to root out   
OL,8,Gracists and misogynists from his       
OL,9,Gorganisation as part of efforts to     
OL,10,Gimprove trust in officers.             
OL,12,FChief Constable Jeremy Vaughan had     
OL,13,Fresponded to a question from MPs about 
OL,14,Fhow he and other police chiefs were    
OL,15,Fclamping down on staff misconduct "in  
OL,16,Fa post-Sarah Everard era".             
OL,18,FThe South Wales Police chief said: "Do 
OL,19,FI think I've got racists, misogynists, 
OL,20,Fworking for me? Yes. Do I think my     
OL,21,Fwork is to find them and excommunicate 
OL,22,Fthem from policing? Absolutely yesG2/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
