OL,4,C'Whole nation behind you' - Nessa      
OL,5,Cdelivers rallying cry for Wales rugby  
OL,6,Cteam                                   
OL,7,GFresh off their historic victory       
OL,8,Gagainst New Zealand's All Blacks,      
OL,9,GGavin and Stacey's Nessa Jenkins has   
OL,10,Gdelivered a rousing message for the    
OL,11,GWales men's team ahead of Saturday's   
OL,12,Ggame against Australia.                
OL,14,FThe popular character, played by Ruth  
OL,15,FJones, delivered some straight-talking 
OL,16,Fadvice ahead of the team's Nations     
OL,17,FChampionship fixture, reminding them   
OL,18,Fthat the whole nation is behind them.  
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
