OL,4,CApplause in court as father of         
OL,5,Cmurdered teen warns killer 'prison     
OL,6,Cwill not go well'                      
OL,7,GApplause could be heard in court as    
OL,8,Gthe father of a 17-year-old boy        
OL,9,Gmurdered by a teenage drug courier     
OL,10,Gdescribed him as a child killer and    
OL,11,Gwarned "prison would not go well" for  
OL,12,Ghim.                                   
OL,14,FKaine Kerr's son, Tristan Kerr, from   
OL,15,FAbertridwr, Caerphilly county, died    
OL,16,Ffrom a single deep stab wound to the   
OL,17,Fheart and lung in February.            
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
